&none      &none       &bt BT_PRV  &bt BT_NXT  &bt BT_SEL 2  &bt BT_SEL 3  &trans         &trans            &trans   &iPad_BT_Macro  &none
&trans     &trans      &tog_of 2   &kp INSERT  &out OUT_BLE  &none         &Mac_BT_Macro  &trans            &none    &none
           &sys_reset  &none       &none       &none         &none         &none          &sys_reset        &kt F15  &bt BT_CLR      &none  &none
