&kp LEFT_SHIFT               &hml LEFT_COMMAND A  &hml LEFT_CONTROL R  &hml LALT S                    &hml LEFT_CONTROL T     &kp D   &none   &hmr LEFT_CONTROL N  &hmr LALT E  &hmr LEFT_CONTROL I  &hmr LEFT_COMMAND O
&UbuntuAppSwWA_Timeless 0 Z  &lt 22 X             &lt 23 C             &lt 21 V                       &UbuntuWindowsSwWA 0 B  &trans  &trans  &trans               &trans       &trans
                             &trans               &trans               &trans                         &lt 14 TAB              &trans  &trans  &trans               &trans       &trans               &trans               &trans
